menu "NoctiNIRS 2 Wi-Fi station"

    config NN2_WIFI_BACKOFF_FIRST_MS
        int "STA reconnect first backoff after the immediate retry (ms)"
        default 500
        range 1 1000
        help
            Delay before the second reconnect attempt. The first attempt
            after WIFI_EVENT_STA_DISCONNECTED is immediate (0 ms) and is
            posted to the station task. This value must be <= 1000 and
            < 3000 so that retry can occur inside the 3 s Wi-Fi-loss grace
            window. The grace timer itself is not implemented here.

    config NN2_WIFI_BACKOFF_MAX_MS
        int "STA reconnect backoff cap (ms)"
        default 8000
        range 1000 60000
        help
            Upper bound for the doubling reconnect delay. The sequence
            after the immediate retry is FIRST, 2*FIRST, ... up to this cap.

endmenu
